  "description": "Camunda 8 process testing for XUnitAssured. Deploys BPMN, starts real process instances on a shared Camunda 8.10 cluster and mocks the diagram's external dependencies per instance, so parallel tests never see each other's jobs. Built on the official Camunda.Orchestration.Sdk.",
